    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "meggan st germain",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117752512098527901186/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUsd_wwWeSwfZryXR0HAY4P1QXyXUr2pHPhLTtWv0eXh0fLFAXZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "I always go there to do my nails and NEVER had any issue with this nail salon. Kathy does my nails every time and she never fails. The retention stays up to a month, she always does exactly what i ask for and she's a really kind person. The place is really clean everything is sanatized and they make sure their clients are comfortable.💞",
        "time": 1769622057,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Soumy Nona",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116102244899334971582/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKYp0_6QSTMm03pMHmhlJCKiAUUDY-S8sVJa8d8XOGGnnflRg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "First time there and the owner was super welcoming, nice and offered me warm tea! His employee was very sweet, always making sure I was satisfied and professional! I recommend 10/10",
        "time": 1768022125,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "NIkki Kaps",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108838294294818875111/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWPY7OjUwcfVUA2F0oVjjjtziMaFnVypm8doVOPteumT_sQw7PIRg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I visited Ongles Neufs last Saturday and was truly impressed. I can be quite particular about my nails, and I left absolutely amazed with the result! The staff were so friendly and welcoming, the service was excellent, and the salon was very clean. I really appreciated how much time and care they took to make sure I was happy with my nails! They never rushed the process. Overall, such a great experience and I will definitely be going back !  🙂",
        "time": 1757184968,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jane Tee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112119591320193282564/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIUjIaiPLyYSuh0WejUNaKLwP6b1a9I-G_LXAfPYeNJfbYQ_g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Beautiful new salon, I would really reccomend giving them a try. They are so warm and inviting, everything is brand new and top of the line, and they have a huge selection of colours including lots of cat eye and chrome options. On top of that the price is much better than the other salons on the area and they did a great job on my nails shaping them naturally like i wanted. I will be back mainly for the people who work here, they really make you want to spend your money here.",
        "time": 1751819576,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "rachel ackerman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104813513771347474933/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7_6_yaF20TMxFwg63J_qfxhL8aOPZ8HRPShTOTUhqtV0TBw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "What a wonderful experience! My nails were so thin and brittle. They applied a Gel product as a base and now my nails are super healthy and are growing! The spa is brand new! Spotless! The staff is so welcoming! Really enjoyed my manicure! Can’t wait to go for a pedicure!",
        "time": 1763597241,
        "translated": false
      }
